WHAT IS AI?

- Artificial Intelligence(AI) refers to the ability of the machine to learn pattern and make predictions.
    AI doesn't replace human decisions; instead it adds value to human judgement.

- In its simplest form, AI is a field that combines computer science and robust datasets to enable
    problem solving.


---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

HOW AI SHOWS UP AT WORK: AUTOMATION, AUGMENTATION, AND HUMAN JUDGEMENT.

- AI supports you professionally in 2 primary ways:

    -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
    1. Automation                                   | 2. Augmentation
    -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
    -> completes repetitive, predictable tasks.     | -> supports thinking and creativity
        eg: calendar app auto scheduling meetings.  |     eg: smart assistant helping you decide
                                                    |           which meeting actually matters.
                                                    |

-> Automation and Augmentation often happens at the same time. But one important rule applies
    to both processes: human remains the ultimate authority. AI provides the speed but you provide
    the direction.
    for example, as a developer you might ask AI to generate a controller endpoints in your application
    but it's upto you to review generated codes and whether to use it or discard.